      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green_Valley_Lake%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 9‑acre lake was created in 1926 when the Green Valley Dam was built, shaping the community’s water system.",
