        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green_Valley_Lake%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Perched near 6,850 ft, the lake earned the nickname “Lake Above the Clouds” for its lofty mountain setting.",
